## 📝 Code Style

### Naming Conventions

```typescript
// Components
const PessoaForm = () => {}          // PascalCase
const TimeCard = () => {}

// Functions
function fetchPessoas() {}           // camelCase
async function updateTime() {}

// Constants
const MAX_FILE_SIZE = 2048           // UPPER_SNAKE_CASE
const DEFAULT_PAGE_SIZE = 20

// Types
interface User {}                    // PascalCase
type PessoaStatus = 'ativo' | 'ferias'

// Database (in SQL/types)
pessoa                               // snake_case
trilha_carreira
data_entrada
```

### File Naming

```
PessoaForm.tsx                       // Components: PascalCase
pessoa.service.ts                    // Services: camelCase
page.tsx                             // Pages: lowercase
[id]/page.tsx                        // Dynamic routes
```

