## 🐛 Priority Fixes Needed

### 1. Modal Issues (CRITICAL)
- [ ] Modals not closing on outside click → Add `onInteractOutside`
- [ ] Modals not closing on ESC → Add `onEscapeKeyDown`
- [ ] Form validation not working in modals
- [ ] Modal state not resetting on close → Reset form on `onOpenChange`
- [ ] Body scroll not blocked → Add `overflow: hidden` to body

### 2. Responsive Issues
- [ ] Sidebar not collapsing on mobile → Fix hamburger menu
- [ ] Tables not responsive → Switch to card view on `< 768px`
- [ ] Breadcrumbs cut off → Make scrollable or truncate

### 3. Component Standardization
- [ ] Button sizes inconsistent → Use `default`, `sm`, `lg` consistently
- [ ] Loading states missing → Add to all list pages
- [ ] Empty states missing → Add to all empty lists

---

## 🔐 LGPD Compliance

### Sensitive Fields (RESTRICTED)

```typescript
// These are SENSITIVE - only managers can see
pessoa.salario_atual
pessoa.data_ultimo_reajuste
pessoa.motivo_ultimo_reajuste
historico_reajuste.*
```

### Access Rules

```typescript
// ✅ Managers: Can see salary of their hierarchy
if (user.tipo_perfil === 'gestor' && isInHierarchy(pessoa, user)) {
  return pessoa // with salary
}

// ❌ Admins: CANNOT see salary data
if (user.tipo_perfil === 'admin') {
  delete pessoa.salario_atual
  delete pessoa.data_ultimo_reajuste
  delete pessoa.motivo_ultimo_reajuste
}

// ❌ Viewers: CANNOT see salary data
if (user.tipo_perfil === 'visualizador') {
  delete pessoa.salario_atual
  delete pessoa.data_ultimo_reajuste
  delete pessoa.motivo_ultimo_reajuste
}
```

---

## 👥 User Types & Permissions

### Admin
- ✅ Manage users, levels, tracks, positions
- ✅ Create/edit ALL teams and people
- ❌ CANNOT view salary data (LGPD)

### Manager (Gestor)
- ✅ Manage teams/people in their hierarchy
- ✅ View salary data of their hierarchy
- ❌ CANNOT access outside hierarchy

### Viewer (Visualizador)
- ✅ View public data only
- ❌ CANNOT edit anything
- ❌ CANNOT view salary data

---

## 🗄️ Database Quick Reference

### Core Tables
- `usuario` - System users (login)
- `nivel` - Levels L1-L16 (hierarchy chain)
- `trilha_carreira` - Career tracks
- `cargo` - Positions (track + level)
- `time` - Teams (recursive hierarchy)
- `pessoa` - People (nullable fields for incremental entry)
- `projeto_produto` - Projects (simple: name + allocations only)

### History Tables (app-managed)
- `historico_mudanca` - Audit log
- `historico_reajuste` - Salary changes (SENSITIVE)
- `historico_time` - Team allocations
- `historico_cargo` - Position history

