Fix modal in [file]: add onInteractOutside to close on outside click,
onEscapeKeyDown for ESC key, and reset form state on onOpenChange
```

### Add Loading State
```
Add LoadingState component to [file] showing 10 skeleton rows
matching the table structure (avatar + name + position + team)
```

### Make Responsive
```
Make table in [file] responsive: switch to card view on mobile (< 768px)
with avatar, name, position, team, and action button stacked vertically
```

### Standardize Buttons
```
